  "body": "This adds one newly qualified real installed Panda1.10.13/default-offSDK8d3/softpipe GLX object/frame canary in authenticated image4984/configb9. It requests one owned Xvfb/engine/output/Texture/GSG/Camera, two parent-nonce8x8RGB challenges with4renders/2RAMreads, then output0/RAMclear. Parent independently verifies complete SDK text and originalread slot to pinnedlibGLentry at three points, live image/driver mappings and frame freshness. This is real software-driver execution, not another CPU callback replay; actual result remains NOT_RUN until sourceCI and fresh activation.\n\nReadonly/networknone/privateIPC/UID65534/caps0/NoNewPrivs/Seccomp2/memory2GiB/CPU1/pids64/tmpfs64MiB/240s. Normal driver/GL/Panda initialization/render/cleanup explicitly permitted only in one new window. Latch consumes beforestart; ownedchild/Xvfb/container cleanup and bounded raw failed/timeout/nonJSON evidence retained, no retry. Generateddriverexec16regions4MiB/private sharedRAM32regions64MiB remain explicitly nonimage/unqualified origins; large image libraries are streamed under192MiB/file/192files768MiB bounds.\n\nValidation:30focusedPASS; all1,711local cases covered(1,704PASS/7skip),normal1,710 plus originalcapacitycase on realspaciousshm. Sole fresh review0Critical/0Important/1Minor; no Important fixpass/rereview/minor polishing. DeferredM1: failed acceptance source_observer_default_off field unconditionally expresses requested policy even if observation missing; failure/false software qualification prevent admission. Actualresult docs must distinguish observed stats from policy and preserve rawreceipt. Sourceclosure260 unchanged; all6,844basefiles/modes,299pins,10originals,main,Drafts102\u2013119,native8/image3/mapping01/dispatch01 histories preserved.\n\nActual new window max1 only after reviewedsourceCI4jobs/artifacts0 and request-only activation. No oldrequest replay/image rebuild/Cloudregistry publication/main/shared-base update or merge. SDKobserver remainsunconfigured/defaultoff; no capture/cache/bridge/sink arming, MetaDrive/model/officialORT/cohort. PhysicalGPU/fullC++ABI/deallocation/completeGLVND-TLSdispatch/productionRGBI420/scientificready remain unqualified. Originalscientificallowance0/strict0of4FAIL/Stage7INCOMPLETE persists.\n\nReview docs/STAGE7_PANDA_REAL_GLX_RESULT.md,docs/STAGE7_PANDA_REAL_GLX_LEDGER.md and docs/evidence/panda-real-glx-01/. Actual success or authenticated failure retained withoutretry; final docs-onlyHEADCI/body/freshpreservation/clean-tree receipt output/stage7-panda-real-glx-01/final-verification.json stays outside its own commit.\n",
